<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabobank ups lira bond to 300 bln.</title>
<headline>Rabobank ups lira bond to 300 bln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 300 billion lira from 250 billion lira, issuer Rabobank said on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER    RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT ITL 300 BLN	COUPON **10 PCT	MATURITY **06.MAR 07</p>
<p> TYPE STRAIGHT	  ISS PRICE 101.15     PAY DATE   06.MAR 97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     REOFFER    99.15     PAY FREQ   =</p>
<p> LISTING LUX	    DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG YES	    CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>** FOR YEARS 1-3, THEN 19.5 PCT LESS (2 X 6M ITL LIBOR)</p>
<p>IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 fax +31 20 504 5040.</p>
</text>
